@startuml Persewaan_Alat_Sequence

title Sequence Diagram - Persewaan Alat

actor User
actor Admin
participant "Equipment / Cart / Checkout" as View
participant "EquipmentPublicController" as PublicController
participant "CheckoutController" as CheckoutController
participant "EquipmentRentalRequestController" as AdminController
database DB
participant "Email Service" as Mail

User -> View: Buka katalog alat
View -> PublicController: index()
PublicController -> DB: Ambil alat tersedia
DB --> PublicController: Data alat
PublicController --> View: Tampilkan katalog

User -> View: Tambah ke keranjang dan checkout
View -> CheckoutController: store(request)
CheckoutController -> DB: Simpan order pending + items
DB --> CheckoutController: Berhasil
CheckoutController -> Mail: Kirim konfirmasi
Mail --> User: Email pesanan
CheckoutController --> View: Redirect sukses

Admin -> AdminController: Buka daftar pesanan
AdminController -> DB: Ambil pesanan
DB --> AdminController: Data pesanan
AdminController --> Admin: Tampilkan list

Admin -> AdminController: Approve / reject / cancel / complete
AdminController -> DB: Update status pesanan dan keuangan
DB --> AdminController: Berhasil
AdminController --> User: Notifikasi status

@enduml